<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Yahuḏa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yahuḏa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat zi Yahuḏa ɣar ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat zi Yahuḏa ɣar ȓmuminin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Nec ḏ Yahuḏa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yahuḏa-ya aḏ yiȓi ḏ umas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zeg yemmas.</char></note> ḏ axeddam n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, nec ḏ umas n Yaƹqub. <char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i yinni iy d itwaȓaɣan, itḥibba-ṯen Arebbi Babaṯneɣ, iḥeṭṭa-ṯen Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Aḏaywem ṯmarni arraḥmeṯ ḏ ȓehna ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ s waṭṭas.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹiqab x yinni itarran ixef nsen ḏ imseȓmaḏen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ay imƹizzen inu, tuɣa rzuɣ aḏawem ariɣ x ubriḏ nni iy zi nnejjem neccin iy ḏi ncarrec marra, walakin ufiɣ u labud aḏawem ariɣ ṭṭalab-a ḥima aḏ tmenɣem x lʼiman-a iy zi twakellfen ṣṣaliḥin ḏeg yijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Aqa ca iṯarrasen uḏfen-d jarawem war ḏasen d ṯarrim bu ȓexbar, qa lƹiqab nsen yura xas mecḥaȓ zeg wami. Yina ƹeṣṣan Arebbi, sƹewwajen arḍa nnes bac aɣarsen yiȓi am can n ttesriḥ n ccehweṯ. Nekkaren Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy iǧan ḏ Mawlana nneɣ qa netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ waḥḏes.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Waxxa ssneɣ belli ṯessnem manaya, xseɣ akenniw sfekkareɣ mliḥ belli Siḏiṯneɣ ifekk ccaƹb nnes zi Miṣra, walakin menbaƹd yinni war yuminen ca imḥa-ṯen qaƹ. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Ammu ƹaweḏ iweqƹen i lmalaʼikaṯ nni iy yugin aḏ qqiment ḏi lmarṭaba nsent n ssulṭa semḥent ƹaweḏ ḏi ṯzeddiɣṯ nsent. Min ḏasent igga? Iqqen-iṯent s snaseȓ nni war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ, ibelleƹ xasent ḏeg yijjen n ṯaǧest ḏ ṯabercant aȓ Lƹiqab n Nhar nni Ameqqran. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Ammu ƹaweḏ iy ggin imezḏaɣ ḏi <char style="it">ṯendint nni n</char> Sadum ḏ <char style="it">ṯendint nni n</char> Ƹamura ḏ ibilajen nni iy ḏasent-id innḍen. Sellmen ixef nsen i lfasad ḏ ccehweṯ nni maci ṭṭabiƹi. Iƹni niṯni iggi-ṯen Arebbi ḏ lƹibra, twaƹaqben s yijjen n lƹiqab n ṯmessi war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ammu ƹaweḏ iṯarrasen-a. Ƹlaḥsab ṯirja nsen sexnazen ddat nsen, nekkaren ssulṭa, qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin x lmexluqaṯ n ujenna. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Walakin min igga lmalak ameqqran Mikaʼil wami imneɣ ak Ibȓis imnaqar akiḏes x ddat immuṯen n Musa? Waxxa ḏ Mikaʼil-a war izƹim ca aḏ yini ca n wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Ibȓis, yenna-as cek ac inha Siḏi Arebbi! <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Walakin iṯarrasen-a yina ssawaȓen s wawaȓ war iḥȓin x marra min war fehhmen ca. Ṯimesȓayin-a umi fehhmen iwa fehhmen-ṯent s ṭṭabiƹa nsen waha, niṯni ggin am ȓuḥuc iqefȓen. Ṯimesȓayin-a ḏ niṯenti iy ṯen ɣa imḥan!<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Ya ȓefḍiḥeṯ nsen! Tebƹen abriḏ nni n Qabil. Semḥen ḏeg yixef nsen ḍemƹen ḏi tmenyaṯ gguren ḏi lɣaleṭ n Balƹam. Fnan ḏi lḥirak nni n Quraḥ <char style="it">wami iƹarreḍ i Musa</char>. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Iṯarrasen-a yina twessaxen imensiwen nwem n ṯemƹacarṯ. Tetten akiḏwem bȓa ma aḏ seḏḥan, niṯni ggin am ca n imeksawen iy ƹettqen ixef nsen waha. Niṯni ḏ iseynuṯen bȓa yanẓar ɣir itawi-ṯen arriḥ itarra-ṯen. Niṯni ggin am ṯcejjura ḏi ȓexȓif war itarwen ca, tneqȓaƹent-id zeg iẓewran nsent; iƹni ibriḏen nsent mmuṯen s ṯnayen. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Niṯni ggin am ȓemwaj n ȓebḥar ccaṯent s ȓefḍiḥeṯ n ukuffu nsent. Niṯni ggin am can iṯran iffɣen zeg umcan nsen gguren ɣar yijjen n ṯaǧest ḏ ṯabercant ig itwaswejḏen i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Fa Axnux wenni ig iǧan ḏ ayyaw n Adam zi jeddiṯwem wis sebƹa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Lkitab n Luqa, uḏem wis 3 zi lʼayaṯ 37-38: Adam ijja-d Cuṯ, Cuṯ ijja-d Anuc, Anuc ijja-d Qinan, Qinan ijja-d Muhallil, Muhallil ijja-d Yarid, Yarid ijja-d Axnux. </char></note> netta iƹȓem ijjen n wawaȓ zi Arebbi inna-ṯ x iṯarrasen-a: "Xzareṯ, aqa yusa-d Siḏiṯneɣ s waȓaf n uȓufaṯ n imqeddsen nnes <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />aḏ iḥaseb marra iwḏan. Marra yinni iƹeṣṣan aḏasen d ismeḍhar marra ȓefƹayeȓ nsen ṯiƹeffanin iy ggin ḏeg ubriḏ nsen aƹeffan, aḏ ssnen ƹaweḏ marra awaȓen nni war iḥȓin iy xas nnan yinni iƹeṣṣan war ḏeffaren ca Arebbi." <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Cuf, iṯarrasen-a tceṯcan waha, tentaqaḏen x midden, niṯni ḏeffaren ccehawaṯ nsen ṯiƹeffanin; Semɣaren ixef nsen s uqemmum nsen, tesȓehhan iwḏan bac aḏ neffƹen ixef nsen.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Fa kenniw ay imƹizzen inu, fekkareṯ min tuɣa qqaren zi qbeȓ arrusul n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Nnan-awem: "Ḏi ȓiyyam nni ineggura aḏ iȓin mujudin yinni iḏeḥḥcen x yiwḏan, ḏeffaren ccehawaṯ nsen ṯiƹeffanin waha." <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Iwa niṯni ḏ yina iy kenniw ifarrqen, ḏaysen arruḥ n ddunect-a waha war ḏaysen ca Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Kenniw ay imƹizzen inu, bnaṯ ixef nwem ḏi dsas n lʼiman yuƹȓan iy iǧan ḏaywem, ẓaǧem s Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Itxeṣṣa aḏ teqqimem ḏi ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi aḏ trajam arraḥmeṯ nni n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ṯenni iy kenniw itawin ɣar ṯuḏarṯ nni war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Sxeḏmeṯ lḥanana ak yinni itcekkan. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Fekkeṯ inneɣni, jebḏem-ṯen-d zi ṯmessi. Inneɣni sbiyynem-asen-d arraḥmeṯ ṯemxelleṭ ak ṯiggwḏi iƹni aḏ tƹiffem uȓa ḏ arruḍ nsen ig ixenzen s ṭṭabiƹa nsen ṯaƹeffant.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Fa wenni izemmaren akenniw iḥḍa bac war tenḏȓifem ca, izemmar ƹaweḏ akenniw iqeddem ɣar zzaṯ nnes lƹaḍim aḏ tiȓim bȓa ȓƹib aɣarwem ṯiȓi ijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />iƹni Arebbi wenni iǧan waḥḏes isenjam-aneɣ. Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama ḏ ṯuƹȓat ḏ lquwwa ḏ ssulṭa s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ iƹni qbeȓ i marra zmanaṯ iy iƹḏun u ḏ ȓexxu u ḏ ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>